== 3. Round 2's fixes: probe-e.sh (Run) ==
L3 proves nothing: with stdout closed by the shell (>&-) the process's first open file
takes its place, so the print "succeeds" somewhere else. probe-f.sh is the true test of a
print that fails. L5's "setup step failed" line is my helper misreading inbox --quiet's
exit code; the step ran. L7's "command not found: cover" is my script (a helper left out).

